Probe-only patch against nanovms/nanos aad473aa (NOT upstreamed).

pvh_start32 executes `call pvh_zero_page` (init.s:116,121,129) before it sets
`mov esp, 0xa000` (init.s:142). The PVH boot ABI leaves ESP unspecified, and
Cloud Hypervisor v53.0 enters PVH with RSP=0 (arch/src/x86_64/regs.rs:100-104),
so the first call pushes its return address to 0xfffffffc (unbacked) and the
matching ret pops garbage. Set the same stack pointer the code already uses,
before the first call. The later `mov esp, 0xa000` is left in place.

--- a/src/x86_64/init.s
+++ b/src/x86_64/init.s
@@ -107,5 +107,6 @@ extern pvh_start

 bits 32
 pvh_start32:
+        mov esp, 0xa000
         PREPARE_LONG_MODE eax
         ; set up minimal mapping to be able to run in 64-bit mode, carving page
